From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Telesphoreo <me@telesphoreo.me>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:26:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Prevent unsafe equipment state and repair saved players

Enforce finite modifiers and audited overlays at component construction. Restrict player equipment at its storage boundary and normalize client-visible equipment targets in both codecs. These invariants cover nested items and templates without carrier-specific checks.

Recover legacy hidden equipment automatically, retain overflow, and remove its effects. Preserve equipment snapshots during online reload. Remove stale operation entries when replacing attribute modifiers so removed items cannot leave phantom effects.

